{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/11976","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"11976","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"PS3543.A653 Z52","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Fragments from an unwritten autobiography  ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Carl Van Vechten","id":"actor/van-vechten-carl","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"Yale University","id":"actor/yale-university-library","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1955","begin_of_the_begin":"1955-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_of_the_end":"1955-01-01T00:00:00Z","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Ephemera found in front of half t.p. : Newspaper clipping : article about Carl Van Vechten being honored by the New York Public Library, New York Herald Tribune.\nGeorgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nThese papers first appeared in the Yale University Library gazette for January and July 1948, April 1949, April 1950, January 1951, and January 1952. They are here reprinted in honor of their author's seventy-fifth birthday, June 17, 1955--Vol. 1, prelim. p. [5].","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"abq v. 1, v. 2 : fine condition ; slipcase : good condition.|SColl abq v. 1 : Inscription on front loose endpaper from [Carl Van Vechten] to Georgia [O'Keeffe] : For Georgia / with love / from / Carlo / Noel, 1955 / New York.|SColl abq v. 1, v. 2 : Embossed stamp on front loose endpaper : Georgia O'Keeffe / Abiquiu, New Mexico.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}